# Response templates of the behavior-rule catalog (R1188-U1).
#
# The topic labels, rule labels, matched prompts, response descriptions and
# When X then Y statements that `List behavior rules` and `Show behavior rule`
# render, the list footer, and the answers to a rule taught in the dialog.
# Both roots read them by intent (rust/src/solver_handlers/behavior_rules.rs,
# js/worker/formal_ai_worker_03.js) instead of holding the prose and its
# example prompts in code. Placeholders in braces are filled by the handler.

